{"product":{"id":7413062991915,"title":"Royal California White Sturgeon Caviar","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"editable-text\" id=\"wsite-com-product-title\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003eRoyal White Sturgeon Caviar offers a wonderfully nutty taste and stunning color, ranging from deep amber to dark gold. It is lighter in color and slightly bolder in flavor compared to traditional or \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/classic-california-white-sturgeon-caviar\/\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003eclassic california \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/classic-california-white-sturgeon-caviar\/\"\u003eWhite Sturgeon\u003c\/a\u003e or \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/caviarstar.com\/products\/classic-italian-white-sturgeon-caviar\"\u003eItalian White Sturgeon Caviar.\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"editable-text\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003eThis premium product comes from the North American White Sturgeon, the largest American sturgeon and the third largest sturgeon species in the world. White Sturgeon caviar is consistently fresh and of exceptional quality, celebrated for its clean, delicate flavor and creamy finish. Sourced from Sacramento, California, this medium-sized roe is farm-raised in full compliance with international health, animal welfare, and environmental regulations.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eEach jar is hand-packed and carefully inspected for optimal color, size, freshness, flavor, and texture. For additional details on shipping, usage, and privacy policies, please visit our Policy Page \u003ca href=\"\/pages\/policies\"\u003ePolicy Page.\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Caviar Star","product_type":"physical","created_at":"2025-07-11T03:54:35-04:00","handle":"royal-california-white-sturgeon-caviar","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:44-0